TITLE=E2E-55: TTM — PR-lifecycle capture (time-to-merge, stage 1)
TAGS=ttm,storage
MODE=dynamo
BODY=Open a PR, push once more, then merge it; separately open a second PR and close it without merging. Inspect the PRLifecycleRecord store (DynamoDB mergewatch-pr-lifecycle / Postgres pr_lifecycle). No harness PR — manual open/push/merge/close.
